Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1600
Set Height 800
Set FontSize 28
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 10
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"

Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH" Enter
Type "clownhead() { python tools/demo.py; }" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "clownhead" Sleep 600ms Enter
Sleep 3s

Right Sleep 3500ms
Left Sleep 1s

Down Sleep 1800ms
Down Sleep 1800ms

Type "c" Sleep 2500ms

Type "/" Sleep 400ms
Type "web" Sleep 2500ms
Escape Sleep 1800ms
